# In production, no env vars are required — EdgeOne KV is exposed automatically
# to Pages Functions via the `MYSTAR_KV` binding (configured in the EdgeOne
# console under Pages → KV 存储 → bind namespace "star" to your project with
# variable name MYSTAR_KV).
#
# This file is only used by `npm run dev` locally. There are no required keys;
# create a `.env` only if you want to override the dev server's PORT.
# PORT=8000
